          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17332
        }
      ],
      "words": 86
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Beau shifted beneath me. “Are you asleep?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18829
        },
        {
          "text": "“Unfortunately.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18899
        },
        {
          "text": "He laughed softly. “Want to let me into the maze in your head?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18914
        },
        {
          "text": "I lifted my head and looked at him. “How I lost everything important to me and then I found you. And you showed me what ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19462
        },
        {
          "text": "His eyebrows rose. “I love you, sweetheart. I know I don’t say it a lot, but I want you to know it’s always on my mind. ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19647
        },
        {
          "text": "I smiled, his words washing over me and easing every thought in my mind. “I know, I love you, too.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19788
        },
        {
